{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelite card game where you run a ramen stall in a cyberpunk city.<br>Earn money to upgrade your skills and toppings, and serve even more powerful bowls of ramen.<br>An immersive yet casual strategic card game experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144860/extras/7748ca0fbeae0b60c5ff6ba06138862d.poster.avif?t=1762817929\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144860/extras/7748ca0fbeae0b60c5ff6ba06138862d.webm?t=1762817929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144860/extras/7748ca0fbeae0b60c5ff6ba06138862d.mp4?t=1762817929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>I'm also planning to release English and Chinese versions.</u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple game about plating toppings on your ramen.<br>Each run alternates between serving ramen at your stall and preparing for the next day, aiming to create the ultimate bowl.<br>If you fail to satisfy the gourmet customer who appears at the end of each stage, your run ends immediately.<br>Survive all ten days of operation to complete the run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144860/extras/00f67543c52082fcb98ed4615730c885.avif?t=1762817929\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After leaving  the gang, you finally start the ramen stall you\u2019ve always dreamed of.<br>But one day, an old friend from your former family shows up \u2014 a woman reluctantly sent to bring you back.<br>To persuade her to let you go, you must prove that you can serve ramen so good it changes her mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144860/extras/6b9b02ffcc8b02cc5bf9cb49042702d2.avif?t=1762817929\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different play experiences each run through random generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple yet strategic gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An art style that harmonizes with the game\u2019s system and atmosphere</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4144860?t=1762817929","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4144860?t=1762817929","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144860/5f9b7b5446414cbd4302623426f2c3416031c664/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762817929","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144860/5f9b7b5446414cbd4302623426f2c3416031c664/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762817929","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelite card game where you run a ramen stall in a cyberpunk city.<br>Earn money to upgrade your skills and toppings, and serve even more powerful bowls of ramen.<br>An immersive yet casual strategic card game experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea